      "heading": "About the transfer balance cap",
      "page": null,
      "text": "The transfer balance cap applies from 1 July 2017. It is a limit on the total amount of superannuation that can be transferred into the retirement phase.\n\nYou can make transfers into the retirement phase as long as you remain below the transfer balance cap.\n\nSpecial rules apply for defined benefit income streams."
    },
    {
